				<description>&lt;p&gt;An article by Christian Gersbach and myself has been published in Festschrift for Adrian von Kaenel,&#xA;in which we trace current developments in social plans in Swiss Law. You can access a preview here&#xA;(article in German):&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;fa fa-envelope&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;../../documents/12_FS_von_Kaenel_GERSBACH_WINTER_Vorschau.pdf&#34;&gt;Gersbach/Winter: Sozialpläne – Aktuelle Entwicklungen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions about employment law in general or social compensation plans in particular, &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/en/#contact&#34;&gt;feel free to contact me!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
